note OVITO 3.17.2 reads extended XYZ periodicity and an out-of-cell second frame without wrapping or repeating frame 0.
note mdcompress 1.0.0 is not on PyPI and conda is not installed. apt has no libxdrfile. CC=gcc CXX=g++ make mdcompress links bin/mdcompress; it prints version 2.0.5, not 1.0.0. gcc accepts -fabi-version=6, which is the flag clang rejected. The coordinate-only row stays omitted rather than labeling 2.0.5 as 1.0.0.
note h2h10 printed readcon-con and chemfiles-con writes as 0.0794 s. The raw samples differ (readcon 0.079409, chemfiles 0.079377); four decimal places hid that. Chemfiles has no CON writer. Its write copies coordinates into a Frame. Both rows stored the readcon CON size, 45378064, which is not chemfiles' output. The interleaved fresh-process write was slower than a back-to-back write_columns loop. This table's 1M readcon-con write is that back-to-back serial measurement, 0.0622 s. Default threads are 0.0402 s.
